1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,620
Why don't we just dump our trash

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,460
into the deepest ocean trench?

3
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,380
The seafloor there

4
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:05,380
slides into the Earth,

5
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,500
so it eats everything,

6
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,300
right?

7
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,900
But it slides about as fast

8
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,540
as your fingernails grow.

9
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,020
So one trash bag takes

10
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,980
millions of years to go down.

11
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:14,767
Even then,

12
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:15,620
some of what sinks

13
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,820
ends up in magma,

14
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,860
which means a bit of your

15
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,620
trash could come back up...

16
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,240
through a volcano.
